{"orgCode":"7502","name":"Department of Technology","agencyCode":"7500","agencyName":"Government Operations","description":"The California Department of Technology is committed to partnering with state, local government, and educational entities to advance California's technology and ensure secure, equitable, and reliable solutions through effective policy and oversight, statewide strategies, and innovative services.","website":"https://www.cio.ca.gov","totals":{"amounts":{"py":2285527,"cy":383694,"by":56388},"positions":{"py":981,"cy":1063.5,"by":1056.5},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":0,"cy":10,"by":50010},"nongovernmental":{"py":620989,"cy":837988,"by":948313}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/7500/7502","kind":"department","name":"Department of Technology","code":"7502","amounts":{"py":2285527,"cy":383694,"by":56388},"positions":{"py":981,"cy":1063.5,"by":1056.5},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":2247514,"cy":340350,"by":56388},"federal":{"py":38013,"cy":43344,"by":0}},"children":[{"id":"exp/7500/7502/6230","kind":"program","name":"Department of Technology","code":"6230","amounts":{"py":2285527,"cy":383694,"by":56388},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":2247514,"cy":340350,"by":56388},"federal":{"py":38013,"cy":43344,"by":0}},"positions":{"py":981,"cy":1063.5,"by":1056.5},"description":"6230 - DEPARTMENT OF TECHNOLOGY\n\nThe Department maintains up-to-date policies for IT, business telecommunications and broadband goods, systems and services to ensure the state adopts and uses best practices in the management of state IT, telecommunications and broadband infrastructure. The Department develops annually the California Information Technology Strategic Plan, establishes statewide IT, telecommunications, and broadband policies and standards, facilitates the development and implementation of enterprise initiatives, and maintains a governance structure to address issues and concerns that arise as part of technology deployment.\n\nThe Department ensures that project-specific decisions are consistent with the state's policies and direction for IT development, including project management, oversight, and risk mitigation. The Department also ensures the coordination and collaboration of enterprise and other multi-department IT efforts, as well as standardization of project management processes and performance metrics, to facilitate the uniform assessment of project performance.\n\nThe Office of Technology Services (OTech) provides IT services to state and local government entities throughout California. Through the use of a scalable, reliable, and secure statewide network, combined with voice and data technologies, OTech delivers computing, networking, e-mail, and cloud services.\n\nWithin the Department, the Office of Information Security is the primary state government authority responsible for ensuring the protection of state information, as well as the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of state systems and applications.\n\nThe Office of Statewide Project Delivery bolsters the successful delivery of IT projects through direct engagement and collaboration with state entities. The office is responsible for the planning, approval, procurement, execution, and oversight of state IT projects. The Office of Statewide Technology Procurement conducts independent project oversight for state project acquisitions of information technology and telecommunications goods and services.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":2906516,"cy":1221692,"by":1054711}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/7500/7502/6230/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":2247514,"cy":340350,"by":56388},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":2247514,"cy":340350,"by":56388}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":2247514,"cy":340350,"by":56388}}}},{"id":"exp/7500/7502/6230/f0890","kind":"fund","name":"Federal Trust Fund","code":"0890","amounts":{"py":38013,"cy":43344,"by":0},"byFundType"